notes:        Generated by the contributor with Adobe After Effects 2026 as their own test data for the effectcraft-aep tests (saved by After Effects from the contributor's case 850 with the Fill's switch flag set to 0 in a copy and the fill colour set by script); contains only synthetic project structure, no third-party footage, presets, templates or personal data. No Adobe sample project or asset was used. The project container is byte-identical to the generated file; the XMP packet after it was replaced by the (smaller) packet of the base project to keep the fixtures small.
